Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.94,0:00:06.94,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)}Tinasha's Familiar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.18,0:00:21.58,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Lady Tinasha, how are you feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.51,0:00:27.39,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I'll cut your hair for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:34.10,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Aren't you scared of a witch like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.10,0:00:36.34,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Witches are frightening, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.66,0:00:39.47,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I'm familiar with the records \Nof the five witches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.47,0:00:42.81,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I read that they once destroyed \Na nation in a single night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.81,0:00:45.03,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Why, that's simply terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:49.82,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,However, you don't look like you would do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.82,0:00:52.53,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,I have a very different \Nimpression of witches now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:54.11,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.11,0:00:55.80,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,What about you, Lady Tinasha?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.80,0:00:58.98,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Are there things you're \Nscared of or can't handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:01.33,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Can't handle?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.33,0:01:04.06,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,There were a lot of things in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:07.37,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,but it's all been worn away \Nafter living for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.21,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,As for now...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.21,0:01:14.13,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I don't like being forced into bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.13,0:01:15.82,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.82,0:01:18.35,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,Like a child being put to bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.95,0:01:22.53,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Also, I can't handle Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:25.03,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I can never tell what he's thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.54,0:01:30.77,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I think he thinks of me like a cat \Nhe took in off the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.08,0:01:34.03,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,You seem to get along wonderfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.03,0:01:35.18,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.18,0:01:36.51,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Wonderfully?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:12.96,Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,1)}~ What the Forest Dreams Of ~
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.81,0:03:20.84,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,And so, Father, this is \Nthe Witch of the Azure Moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.84,0:03:22.54,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I plan on taking her as my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.54,0:03:23.77,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Not happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.77,0:03:26.22,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I was trying to keep quiet, \Nbut this nonsense again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.22,0:03:29.18,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm only here to lift his curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.18,0:03:32.19,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\pos(380,290)}King of Farsas   Kevin    {\fs14}Oscar's Father
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.48,0:03:32.91,Default-Top,Kevin,0,0,0,,Will you be able to break the curse on my son?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:35.81,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I've run into some difficulty in its analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.23,0:03:38.97,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It'll be some time \Nbefore I finish deciphering it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.51,0:03:42.46,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,But, well, I'll figure something out in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.46,0:03:43.86,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Please rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.86,0:03:46.94,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,If you fail, you can take full responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.94,0:03:48.45,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Don't talk like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:52.56,Default-Top,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You really need to start acting like \Nthe crown prince you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.73,0:03:54.45,Default,Kevin,0,0,0,,They seem to be on good terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.56,0:03:53.97,Default-Top,Oscar,0,0,0,,In what way?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.97,0:03:57.66,Default-Top,Tinasha,0,0,0,,For one, you could stop \Nwith the unnecessary comments!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.85,0:03:56.81,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,They do get along.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.66,0:03:58.42,Default-Top,Oscar,0,0,0,,There's more?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:06.72,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,We're lucky that she sustained a serious \Nwound after defeating the demonic beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:09.18,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,That's how we managed to get our hands on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:12.18,Default-Top,Miralys,0,0,0,,You mean the Witch of the Azure Moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:12.18,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\pos(193,295)}Valt
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.18,0:04:12.18,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\pos(499,295)}Miralys
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:13.10,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.10,0:04:15.65,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,The strongest of the witches, \Nas far as I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.50,0:04:18.82,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.82,0:04:20.50,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,What do we have here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:23.85,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,What nation do you mages hail from?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:26.86,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.86,0:04:31.06,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,I thought I'd have to clean up after \Nthe whelp that used to be here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:33.16,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,but it looks like that girl took care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.16,0:04:36.63,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,She's been searching for you for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.93,0:04:38.46,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:42.59,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,I'll be the one to go and find her, \Nwhen the time is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.98,0:04:45.05,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll be delighted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.55,0:04:47.02,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,Delighted?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.02,0:04:48.69,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.69,0:04:51.27,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,She's wanted to see me all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.53,0:04:56.85,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,In every history, you treat her \Nwith such arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.85,0:04:58.75,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,In every history?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.75,0:05:00.32,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,Whatever could you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:02.18,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,It doesn't concern you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.07,0:05:05.15,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,I'm nothing more than a bystander.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.54,0:05:09.54,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,You say that, but you appear \Nto have your own designs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.97,0:05:11.71,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,Nothing of importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:14.42,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,We help bring about events \Nthat should occur.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:17.62,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,That is the sole purpose of our kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:20.34,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,And if I refuse to let you go freely?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:24.18,Default,Valt,0,0,0,,Miralys, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.51,0:05:30.97,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,That girl is special to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.26,0:05:33.27,Default,Lanak,0,0,0,,I won't allow any unnecessary meddling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.59,0:05:35.71,Default,Miralys,0,0,0,,Valt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:38.18,Default,Miralys,0,0,0,,Wait, Valt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.18,0:05:42.43,Default,Miralys,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:45.94,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\fs14}Northeastern Farsas    {\fs18}Byle Forest
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:49.59,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,So this is the forest \Nwhere it's been happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.14,0:05:51.82,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,This place is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.37,0:05:54.21,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,We shouldn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:56.88,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Nine villagers have been left dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.88,0:05:59.33,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,found as dried, shriveled up bodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:03.30,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,That's why we need to find the \Ncause as soon as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.70,0:06:06.66,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,We really should stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.66,0:06:09.76,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Lady Tinasha will be furious if she finds out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:11.30,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,So it works out perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.30,0:06:14.93,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,She never lets me do anything \Nwhen she's around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:18.48,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,But she'll find out if anything \Ntouches my defensive barrier,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.48,0:06:21.02,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,so I need to dodge any attack \Nthat comes my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:23.27,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,I'd rather you just get found out...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.21,0:06:29.29,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,A pearl?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.45,0:06:31.44,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:33.17,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,There's a pearl growing here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:34.79,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,How gullible can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.79,0:06:36.25,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,But it really does look like...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.42,0:06:41.31,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Lazar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.95,0:06:42.84,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Wh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:44.80,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,What {\i1}are{\i0} these?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:45.96,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Strange plants?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.33,0:06:48.29,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,I-Is this what's been killing people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.29,0:06:49.22,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:52.07,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,They {\i1}do{\i0} look like they'd suck \Nthe moisture out of their prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.26,0:06:55.04,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Lazar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.04,0:06:56.58,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Be good and stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.58,0:06:57.85,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Look, Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.31,0:06:59.39,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,That's a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.36,0:07:08.32,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Oh no! Poison!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:09.90,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Lazar, let's run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.58,0:07:21.58,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Lazar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.58,0:07:22.59,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Are you all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:25.95,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,What are you doing in these woods?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.99,0:07:45.98,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Lazar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.19,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.15,0:07:51.57,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Your Highness, am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.57,0:07:53.40,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.40,0:07:55.03,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,She gave you an antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.03,0:07:56.27,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.83,0:08:00.20,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.34,0:08:03.33,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.17,0:08:06.25,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Um, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:07.88,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.88,0:08:10.08,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,My name is Lucrezia,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.08,0:08:13.01,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,but few call me by that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:16.51,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Everyone calls me the Witch \Nof the Forbidden Forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.74,0:08:23.78,White-Standard,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\pos(320,290)}Lucrezia    {\fs14}Witch of the Forbidden Forest
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.29,0:08:27.11,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Is Tinasha the same as ever?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.41,0:08:28.90,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,You know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.90,0:08:29.82,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Sure I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:33.38,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,I've known her since she became a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.57,0:08:39.33,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,It was obvious, since she's the only one \Nwho could cast that defensive barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.33,0:08:41.02,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,What is she up to now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.02,0:08:42.94,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Still hiding in that tower of hers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:46.00,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,No, she's acting as my protector now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.00,0:08:47.28,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.28,0:08:50.10,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,So you climbed that tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:53.47,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,It seemed like a real nasty challenge to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:56.74,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,His Highness practically \Nclimbed that tower alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:08:58.18,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,What, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:09:00.02,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,That's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.02,0:09:01.64,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,What contract did you form?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:04.02,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Did you ask to reign over the entire world?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:05.49,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.49,0:09:08.55,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,His Highness wants to marry Lady Tinasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.27,0:09:11.44,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Lazar, I swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:14.36,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.36,0:09:15.60,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:17.60,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Well, she turned me down,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.60,0:09:19.37,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,so she's my protector instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.93,0:09:22.19,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.63,0:09:24.19,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,But I like the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.19,0:09:26.33,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,It won't be easy, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.65,0:09:28.18,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Not easy, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:30.54,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,It'll be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.54,0:09:34.61,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,That prude has been \Na spirit sorcerer for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.61,0:09:36.86,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,She's not keen to find a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.86,0:09:38.26,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.61,0:09:43.90,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Among mages, spirit sorcerers \Nare unique in that they must remain pure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.61,0:09:47.10,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,After mingling souls while having sex,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.10,0:09:51.33,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,the magical power needed to perform \Nspirit magic increases dramatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.70,0:09:59.01,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,I imagine that with her power, \Nit'd hardly make a difference, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.01,0:10:02.15,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,It wouldn't hurt her to try marriage once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.35,0:10:10.33,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,I can help you out, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.85,0:10:13.06,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Would you like me to give you an aphrodisiac?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:18.49,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Normal potions won't work on her, \Nbut the ones I make might do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.89,0:10:20.10,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.09,0:10:23.46,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Well, in that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.11,0:10:28.11,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,How about something more \Ninteresting than an aphrodisiac?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.91,0:10:36.66,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Oh, how scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:39.78,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Unlike Tinasha, fighting's not my forte.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.78,0:10:40.82,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,So, spare me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:42.30,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.30,0:10:43.82,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Y-Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.82,0:10:48.58,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,She {\i1}did{\i0} save us, and we figured out \Nthe cause of those mysterious deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.58,0:10:50.87,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Let's take our leave for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.87,0:10:51.70,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:54.57,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Feel free to visit anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.31,0:11:08.78,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Did you face any problems while I was out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.55,0:11:11.60,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,N-Nothing I can think of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.60,0:11:13.13,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.13,0:11:14.56,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.30,0:11:18.52,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Did you finish airing out \Nyour magic implements?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:20.28,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Yes, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:25.17,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I have many that are tricky to handle, \Nso I couldn't leave it to my familiars.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.17,0:11:27.13,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for leaving the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:28.38,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Think nothing of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.38,0:11:31.81,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,In fact, you should take breaks more often...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.81,0:11:32.97,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'm going out for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.97,0:11:34.22,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Ah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.23,0:11:41.76,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What? Do I have something on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:43.74,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.59,0:11:47.47,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar, are you feeling well?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.47,0:11:48.86,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Perfectly healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.86,0:11:50.43,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What's this now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.43,0:11:51.94,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Never mind, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.50,0:12:15.39,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.39,0:12:17.67,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar, are you getting plenty of sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.22,0:12:19.17,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.63,0:12:21.33,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'm not tired at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.70,0:12:26.18,Default,Fake Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.93,0:12:30.35,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.11,0:12:32.97,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,No, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.41,0:12:36.21,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I just felt like I almost remembered something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.21,0:12:38.03,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You're not fully awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.03,0:12:40.19,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Please, just get some proper sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.19,0:12:42.11,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I said I'm sleeping fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.55,0:12:45.41,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Why are you so concerned about my sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.41,0:12:46.72,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:49.47,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Just don't let it get in the way of your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:54.10,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,She's acting strangely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.93,0:12:59.97,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,G-Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.97,0:13:01.74,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:04.90,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,By the way, I wanted to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.90,0:13:06.89,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:10.10,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Has Oscar been getting enough sleep lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.33,0:13:12.53,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.53,0:13:15.59,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,He's not staying up particularly late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.06,0:13:17.52,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.52,0:13:18.77,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.77,0:13:21.48,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,How about any recent lovers?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.23,0:13:23.36,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Who are you asking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.36,0:13:24.50,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I mean Oscar's.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.41,0:13:26.45,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,None at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.90,0:13:30.41,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,No one, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:32.14,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,I swear, there's no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.61,0:13:34.54,Default,Lazar,0,0,0,,Oh, is this jealousy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.54,0:13:37.09,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Save your nonsense for your sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.26,0:13:38.93,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,A...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.33,0:13:41.08,Default,Group,0,0,0,,A lover?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.08,0:13:46.33,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,He seems unaware of it, but his life force \Nhas been fluctuating lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.33,0:13:49.89,Default-Top,Tinasha,0,0,0,,If he has a lover, \Nhe should just make it public.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.72,0:13:50.72,White-Standard,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,500)\pos(294,290)}Doan    {\fs14}Farsas Mage
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:52.25,Default-Top,Doan,0,0,0,,I thought no one would be brave enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.25,0:13:54.44,Default,Kav,0,0,0,,It's hard to imagine, really...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:57.48,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,He reeks of lingering perfume.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.78,0:13:59.85,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I guess he doesn't notice it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.34,0:14:06.25,Default,Doan,0,0,0,,I saw him earlier today, \Nbut I didn't notice any scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.25,0:14:07.22,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:10.70,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It's really obvious when you stand next to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:11.99,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:22.85,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Sorry, I need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:27.40,Default,Sylvia,0,0,0,,S-So scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:29.31,Default,Doan,0,0,0,,Who would cheat on {\i1}that{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.73,0:14:31.97,Default,Kav,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.71,0:14:33.85,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.42,0:14:35.81,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Tinasha?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.57,0:14:38.04,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Don't give me that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.04,0:14:41.09,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me you met Lucrezia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.05,0:14:45.19,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I kept quiet because \NI didn't think it was a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.19,0:14:46.11,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.47,0:14:49.24,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,If meeting a witch is no big deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:51.70,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,then life would be\N nothing but trivial matters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:53.74,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,That might be the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:56.92,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Please do something about \Nthat stunted sense of danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.92,0:14:59.88,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I told you that psychological \Nattacks can still affect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.88,0:15:02.17,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Having confidence is one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:04.38,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,but I won't be held \Nresponsible if it kills you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.69,0:15:06.01,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,If it kills me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:08.09,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Luckily, I noticed in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.69,0:15:11.54,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,This spell disguises itself \Nas a lover in your dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.54,0:15:15.65,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,and gradually steals your life force \Nthrough sexual intercourse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.65,0:15:20.36,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,If it acts quickly, the victim ends up \Ndying in about one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:21.15,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:25.32,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You should be having erotic dreams every night.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.32,0:15:28.28,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I bet they get erased from \Nyour memories when you wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.28,0:15:30.34,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,How did you figure it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.91,0:15:32.16,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,The scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.16,0:15:37.03,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You smell strongly of flowers, \Nlike ladies' perfume.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.03,0:15:40.29,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Which is why I assumed you had a lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.29,0:15:41.36,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.36,0:15:43.79,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Or wait, do I really smell like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.57,0:15:45.79,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:50.36,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It looks like I'm the only one \Nwho can smell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.36,0:15:51.82,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That damn pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.43,0:15:54.54,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:56.42,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,I'll lift the curse tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.42,0:15:59.22,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Your life force has already begun to flicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.22,0:16:03.27,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Forcibly breaking the spell from \Nthe outside could cost you your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.27,0:16:05.65,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.97,0:16:08.48,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,We'll forcibly break it from within.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.48,0:16:10.40,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,We have to resort to force, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:12.07,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Just be quiet and go to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.66,0:16:53.70,Default,Fake Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.55,0:17:13.61,Default,Fake Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.73,0:17:18.81,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.43,0:17:23.93,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,How tasteless.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.41,0:17:32.57,Default,Fake Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.15,0:17:36.02,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,My hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.80,0:17:39.36,Default,Fake Tinasha,0,0,0,,Oscar...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.31,0:17:42.83,Default,Fake Tinasha,0,0,0,,Please stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.30,0:17:47.66,Default,Fake Tinasha,0,0,0,,I beg you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.66,0:17:50.00,Default,Fake Tinasha,0,0,0,,Help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.62,0:17:52.01,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Stop it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:53.84,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.83,0:17:57.80,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.81,0:18:14.93,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Tinasha...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.43,0:18:32.87,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.11,0:18:36.87,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You got back all the life force \Nshe stole from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.58,0:18:40.63,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:43.82,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,make me kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.64,0:18:46.43,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:47.82,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Even so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.64,0:18:49.66,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.21,0:18:52.52,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,As long as you wield that sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.15,0:18:57.74,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,you might have to kill me in real life someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.17,0:18:59.97,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Are you being serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.97,0:19:00.74,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.03,0:19:04.03,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.03,0:19:06.62,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Get some good rest tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.27,0:19:16.13,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Lucrezia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.13,0:19:18.05,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Tinasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:20.98,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Oh, you let your body grow?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:22.60,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.60,0:19:24.51,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That's some sick taste you have!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.51,0:19:27.77,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,The real sick part is \Nthe way you broke that curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.77,0:19:30.73,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd make him snap your neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.01,0:19:34.17,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It was the fastest way, \Nand it made me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.17,0:19:38.20,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,It should be obvious \Nthat I made a contract with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.20,0:19:39.81,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Why would you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.41,0:19:43.66,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Think of it as a little greeting \Nafter all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.00,0:19:46.38,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You almost killed someone with that greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.29,0:19:49.01,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.01,0:19:51.20,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,What did that contract holder say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.20,0:19:54.64,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,He got angry because I made \Nhim break my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.64,0:19:56.77,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,I mean, sure he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.77,0:19:58.50,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Must have left a bad taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.50,0:20:01.84,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,That'd be rich from the owner of Akashia...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.84,0:20:04.06,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,He sure was manly, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:06.05,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,If you're not interested, can I have him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.05,0:20:07.90,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Go ahead, take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.46,0:20:11.03,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,No, I take that back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.03,0:20:13.31,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,What, having second thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.31,0:20:17.40,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,No, it'd be bad to introduce \Na witch's blood is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.40,0:20:20.66,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Oh, he's caught up \Nin that whole mess, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:22.99,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,The Witch of Silence, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.51,0:20:26.70,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Breaking that will take some work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.10,0:20:28.66,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.63,0:20:31.50,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.50,0:20:32.41,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:33.91,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,My way of apologizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:37.29,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,His blood and sperm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.70,0:20:40.92,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,I think those would be \Nthe most affected by the curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.92,0:20:42.80,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You took these from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.80,0:20:46.88,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,You really should do something about \Nthat awful hoarding habit of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.88,0:20:49.10,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Aren't you a little too angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.38,0:20:54.33,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,You know, that spell wasn't meant \Nto make a copy of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.33,0:20:57.78,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,All I did was have it reflect his own desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.29,0:21:01.18,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Whose fault is it that we're \Nfighting in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:03.18,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Yours, for being so stubborn, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.57,0:21:06.58,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,Why don't you go back and just apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.85,0:21:11.04,Default,Lucrezia,0,0,0,,I think he really cherishes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.15,0:21:19.93,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Step inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.05,0:21:26.90,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.31,0:21:34.05,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:49.41,Default,Oscar,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.95,0:21:57.33,Default,Tinasha,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.39,0:23:39.93,Next Ep Title,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1)}~ A Breath of Life into Image ~
